{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE. LOOT. ESCAPE\u2026 AND BET IT ALL AT THE CASINO.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A multiplayer horror game where every run is a gamble.<br>Face cursed locations, choose your game mode, earn money\u2026<br>and decide whether you\u2019re crazy enough to risk everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLAYER EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with friends in an intense cooperative experience where communication and decision-making make all the difference.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer horror game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperation and constant tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match is different</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the original story behind each map:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919430/extras/5e0d03a62cede7ccd7149ed73485a4d0.poster.avif?t=1768228481\" width=1000 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919430/extras/5e0d03a62cede7ccd7149ed73485a4d0.webm?t=1768228481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919430/extras/5e0d03a62cede7ccd7149ed73485a4d0.mp4?t=1768228481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique narrative for every location</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Specific gameplay mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scripted and oppressive atmosphere</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LOOT MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the map to steal\u2026 and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919430/extras/944593b44ddf17b761509bc1435a51cb.poster.avif?t=1768228481\" width=1000 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919430/extras/944593b44ddf17b761509bc1435a51cb.webm?t=1768228481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919430/extras/944593b44ddf17b761509bc1435a51cb.mp4?t=1768228481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal items scattered across the map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take risks to increase your rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you stay, the greater the danger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dying means losing everything</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCAPE MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One objective: make it out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919430/extras/d9a40bc990924eb8ad9bc9dbfcb02774.poster.avif?t=1768228481\" width=1000 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919430/extras/d9a40bc990924eb8ad9bc9dbfcb02774.webm?t=1768228481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919430/extras/d9a40bc990924eb8ad9bc9dbfcb02774.mp4?t=1768228481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the map to find key items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft the required elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple possible exits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one exit to choose</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EARN MONEY EVERY RUN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter the mode or the map, every game earns you money.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >End-of-run rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression based on risk-taking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for high replayability</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE CASINO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between runs, meet other players in a safe place: <strong>the Casino</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919430/extras/815b93a92382a2d2483f4d53c5be7649.poster.avif?t=1768228481\" width=1000 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919430/extras/815b93a92382a2d2483f4d53c5be7649.webm?t=1768228481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919430/extras/815b93a92382a2d2483f4d53c5be7649.mp4?t=1768228481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Safe zone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Social hub to chat and regroup</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slot machines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bet the money you earned during your runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A place to relax\u2026 or lose everything</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character using the money you earn in-game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919430/extras/29000e4dc01b9e30eeb0d091da17c114.poster.avif?t=1768228481\" width=600 heig